  m_Name: VaseInteracted
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: VaseInteracted
  dialogueLines:
  - Oh look, you knocked it over. Glad you worked so hard for that.
  - Well, you did it. The vase is on the floor. Was that worth all the effort?
  - Oh, wonderful. You knocked over a vase. Truly an impressive achievement.
  - "There it goes. The vase is knocked over. I\u2019m sure that was exactly what
    you were hoping for."
  - Congratulations. You successfully knocked over a completely normal vase. Well
    done.
